{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56696","headline":"十二月三台词（新） 二 · 无名氏","name":"十二月三台词（新） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二月遥望梅林，青条吐叶（下缺）。\n以上均录自郭沫若《出土文物二三事》卷首附一九六九年吐鲁番阿斯塔那唐墓出土卜天寿抄本《论语郑氏注》卷末诗词照片。\n原诗有缺讹，从郭沫若《卜天寿〈论语〉抄本後的诗词杂录》、龙晦《卜天寿〈论语〉抄本後的诗词杂录研究和校释》、任半塘《唐声诗》下编校改。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}